WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.660
[The camera pans across the construction site of the planned National Institutes of Health Clinical Center, building 10.]

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:21.499
[Cars, trucks, and workers come into view.]

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:30.466
[A temporary wooden walkway is shown.]

00:00:30.466 --> 00:00:54.732
[Workers move about in the excavated area.]

00:00:54.733 --> 00:01:19.999
[Temporary plywood support walls are being erected at the perimeter of the pit.]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.400
[Workmen carry lumber, hammer nails, drive earth-moving equipment, and walk around the work site.]

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:35.766
[A LeTourneau motor scraper comes into view.]

00:01:35.766 --> 00:02:11.599
[Workmen carry lumber, hammer nails, drive earth-moving equipment, and walk around the work site.]

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:29.500
[Part of the foundation has been prepared. Forms are in place for the pouring of concrete.]

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:40.933
[A man carries a piece of lumber on his shoulder.]

00:02:40.933 --> 00:03:23.833
[About a dozen workers are atop the wooden framing. A machine for pouring concrete into forms has been positioned.]

00:03:23.833 --> 00:04:05.999
[The camera pans around the site showing mounds of earth, storage sheds, heavy equipment and 1940s-era automobiles.]

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:21.066
[Screen dark]

00:04:21.066 --> 00:05:00.799
[Plywood support wall is shown with men working nearby in the excavated pit.]

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:10.166
[Work near the plywood wall continues.]

00:05:10.166 --> 00:06:39.566
[Camera pans across the large site. Mounds of earth, framing, and temporary steps and ladders are shown.]

00:06:39.566 --> 00:06:44.632
[Screen dark]

00:06:44.633 --> 00:06:59.566
[Camera pans across the area.]

00:06:59.566 --> 00:07:21.232
[A Caterpillar motor grader crosses the worksite.]

00:07:21.233 --> 00:07:30.599
[Another piece of heavy equipment drives by.]

00:07:30.600 --> 00:08:42.566
[Workers add a section to the plywood wall, building it higher.]

00:08:42.566 --> 00:09:40.499
[Film ends]

